  "decision_conditions": [
    "The design of the proposed first floor side extension is not in keeping with that of the existing dwellinghouse. It would result in the erosion of character of this original dwelling and imbalance this row of terraced properties. This is contrary to policies  BP8 and BP11 of the Borough Wide Development Policies DPD and guidance within the Supplementary Planning Document for Residential Extensions and Alterations.",
    "The proposed two storey side extension, due to its scale and siting, would reduce outlook from the neighbouring property at 49a Temple Avenue and result in overshadowing of the garden, detrimental to the residential amenity of the occupant(s) of this property and contrary to policies BP8 and BP11 of the Borough Wide Development Policies Development Plan Document and the Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document."
  ],
